[{"title":"云","author":"缪公恩","text":"一片浓云叆叇光，因风舒捲为谁忙。\n如何不作知时雨，只解漫空掩太阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12386,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"海门风急浪掀天，一叶舟从铁瓮还。\n回首壮游成往事，只馀清梦尚缠绵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12387,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"酒兵无计破愁魔，镫火篷窗莫奈何。\n明月一天秋水阔，不堪复听唱吴歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12388,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"孤舟曾系古淮阴，漂母祠前万古心。\n一种深情在知己，当年原不重黄金。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12389,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"从来歌吹说维扬，我念琼花不再芳。\n今夜窗前看明月，却疑明月是雷塘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12390,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧 其五","author":"缪公恩","text":"消夏湾头碧水流，西施已泛五湖舟。\n试看今日苏台柳，眉黛空含万古愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12391,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧 其六","author":"缪公恩","text":"满眼岚光碧四围，荒衙昼静掩芦扉。\n多情最是山桃树，一片春红艳不飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12392,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧 其七","author":"缪公恩","text":"当日雄谈四座欢，只今独对一镫寒。\n可怜十六年中事，尽作流云逝水看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12393,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧 其八","author":"缪公恩","text":"惭愧巴人只自吟，敢云白雪少知音。\n笑伊彭泽真多事，不设冰弦却蓄琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12394,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题兰贺人","author":"缪公恩","text":"一丛碧玉净无瑕，有梦徵兰绕绛纱。\n应是畹香能解语，双双开作并头花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12395,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题潇湘图","author":"缪公恩","text":"篷窗镫火夜维舟，天水涵虚静不流。\n欲吊湘君何处是，几竿斑竹一湖秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12396,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吴文老以诗见示次韵奉答","author":"缪公恩","text":"当年踪迹逐飘萍，空羡吴山处处青。\n师友半从愁里别，莺花都似梦中经。\n君真佳句追王孟，我亦深情念鹡鸰。\n自是文章本天性，此心私幸有仪型。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12397,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜兼怀舍弟","author":"缪公恩","text":"帘外萧萧半夜风，钟声吹入寂寥中。\n寒窗纸薄霜威重，老木枝疏月影空。\n坐久忽看虚壁白，更阑独对短檠红。\n遥怜弱弟三千里，耿耿离愁有梦通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12398,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过辽阳","author":"缪公恩","text":"东梁河水自西流，漠漠凉烟隐戍楼。\n我欲停骖问华表，夕阳城郭锁凉秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12399,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过首山","author":"缪公恩","text":"故垒遗踪不可寻，荒原何处大星沈。\n迢迢晋魏浮云尽，剩有青山自古今。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12400,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮过浑河","author":"缪公恩","text":"白草荒芦秋色凄，长河光浸暮云低。\n凉波喷雪风声急，古木含烟日影迷。\n隔浦人家空寂寂，绕塍禾黍尚萋萋。\n一鞭遥指残阳路，不计归程信马蹄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12401,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有怀 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"离索劳人太瘦生，不堪重忆旧心情。\n吟馀独向东轩立，翘首天涯看晚情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12402,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有怀 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"何时樽酒逐欢场，楚水吴山道路长。\n我有愁心谁共语，一天黄叶下残阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12403,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游观中值雨 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"杰阁凌虚宝扇开，槐阴松影满楼台。\n一声龙笛西风起，四面烟云暮雨来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12404,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游观中值雨 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"隐隐雷声走碧空，云收雨霁见长虹。\n丹台紫府开仙境，尽在残阳返照中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12405,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游观中值雨 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"上方殿宇倚崔嵬，帘捲秋云列岫开。\n万木低垂新雨后，一天空翠入窗来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12406,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游观中值雨 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"断云拖雨度高空，丹吐霞光剑吐虹。\n风定波平天宇净，分明新月在池中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12407,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"连雨暮晴次唐友梅韵","author":"缪公恩","text":"幽窗几日苦凄迷，霁色初开日影西。\n云蚀长虹当户断，烟拖残雨拂檐低。\n平池积水侵芳草，小径閒花点绿泥。\n好待东山明月上，共携短杖听前溪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12408,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叠前韵","author":"缪公恩","text":"檐溜声中晓梦迷，青虹忽见远林西。\n残云翳日花光淡，宿雨凝烟树影低。\n素壁行蜗新有篆，绿阶生藓净无泥。\n奚童为报山泉长，旧筑渔矶没入溪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12409,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再叠前韵","author":"缪公恩","text":"共指遥山翠影迷，雷声隐隐乱峰西。\n天心忽见云光薄，村外犹看雨脚低。\n豹隐已成三日雾，蛇封未辨一丸泥。\n门前新涨波澜阔，不是前时没胫溪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12410,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨晴同松坡步月河上","author":"缪公恩","text":"急雨初收暑气清，寺门新涨碧痕生。\n半规素月潭心落，中夜潜龙梦里惊。\n细藻纵横迷树影，微风披拂起波声。\n老僧已入维摩定，一任禅镫暗复明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12411,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"红蕉","author":"缪公恩","text":"宵来点点雨声清，朝吐丹葩映日晴。\n笑靥半开应解语，芳心未展尚含情。\n乱翻翡翠遮天绿，碎碾珊瑚照夜明。\n合写簪花淳化帖，窗前宜得万株生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12412,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新秋偶吟","author":"缪公恩","text":"大火西流暑渐收，忽惊节物又清秋。\n露蝉声咽风生柳，篱豆花开月满楼。\n诗卷难传无限事，酒杯能遣几多愁。\n忽来数点潇潇雨，一片凉云淡不流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12413,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶得寒月挂霜枝之句命童子联之松坡遂成一律余即韵成书怀之作","author":"缪公恩","text":"好梦归何处，佳期叹已迟。\n残镫昏纸壁，寒月挂霜枝。\n空有三馀志，难酬万里思。\n徘徊深夜里，此意更谁知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12414,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"又因明月千家雪树影寒霜月二句松坡成篇余亦足成二律 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"更深群籁息，寂寂立寒庭。\n明月千家雪，疏镫一点星。\n天光侵户牖，夜气入虚灵。\n小饮休教醉，长令方寸醒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12415,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"又因明月千家雪树影寒霜月二句松坡成篇余亦足成二律 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"深宵不成寐，卧对一镫红。\n树影寒霜月，钟声度晓风。\n壮心随日去，愁思入诗中。\n岁晚惊心切，长吟百感丛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12416,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜深忽闻风雨凄然感赋","author":"缪公恩","text":"小炉馀火荻灰温，云暗萧斋静掩门。\n半夜惊风吹梦醒，满窗寒雨逼镫昏。\n浊醪力薄难为醉，旧事吟成枉断魂。\n日月如流伤晚岁，此身空尔寄乾坤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12417,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"友人索画兰并题","author":"缪公恩","text":"冰根几本护苍苔，风叶参差露蕊开。\n岂有国香生笔底，却教仙蝶误飞来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12418,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书桃花扇传奇后 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"无愁天子爱繁华，媮取金陵作帝家。\n燕子新词听未足，春风已落后庭花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12419,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书桃花扇传奇后 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"旧院长桥往事空，青山黄土梦魂中。\n南朝多少伤心事，付与桃花扇底风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12420,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书桃花扇传奇后 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"杜鹃血泪洒京门，岭上衣冠枉断魂。\n滚滚长江何处是，梅花影里月黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12421,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜怀旧","author":"缪公恩","text":"帘捲空窗四壁虚，金壶乍永夜何如。\n滴阶露冷蛩声涩，落叶风飘树影疏。\n隍鹿已醒他日梦，塞鸿久断故人书。\n起看北斗阑干堕，残月萧条上草庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12422,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叶本初同其仲兄济范没于海诗以哭之且慰其长兄济东 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"浪捲星槎竟不回，海天无地寄吾哀。\n他年宿草寻何处，永向鲛宫作夜台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12423,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叶本初同其仲兄济范没于海诗以哭之且慰其长兄济东 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"水立云垂海气昏，蓬瀛有召赴龙门。\n望洋欲酬樽前酒，万顷烟波锁断魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12424,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叶本初同其仲兄济范没于海诗以哭之且慰其长兄济东 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"仲子温恭最象贤，李君尔雅更韶年。\n如何携手骑鲸去，同向三壶證水仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12425,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叶本初同其仲兄济范没于海诗以哭之且慰其长兄济东 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"空对鲸波哭杜鹃，修文已入镜中天。\n苍龙宫里回螭驭，知是清宁第几年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12426,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叶本初同其仲兄济范没于海诗以哭之且慰其长兄济东 其五","author":"缪公恩","text":"一夜霜风断雁群，百年泉壤隔音闻。\n凭君且拭伤心泪，极目南天有白云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12427,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜","author":"缪公恩","text":"半夜风吹小雪残，天空北斗挂阑干。\n深宵万籁归岑寂，满地冰花月影寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12428,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡绝句 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"入厨洗手自三朝，病里羹犹手自调。\n为报慈帏增早膳，一时疴痛似全消。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12429,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡绝句 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"双双儿女缀班联，五岁娇娃意最怜。\n犹禁芳阶閒斗草，却教拈线绣床前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12430,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡绝句 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"倚枕支颐制豆娘，五文弱线烂生光。\n不知气比游丝细，反为儿曹续命长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12431,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡绝句 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"日沈翘首望云天，一种深情已暗传。\n向晓不言畴昔梦，泪花瑩澈枕函边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12432,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡绝句 其五","author":"缪公恩","text":"雅意相关姊妹行，几回分赠嫁衣裳。\n惟存数幅亲花绣，犹自尘封黄竹箱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12433,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡绝句 其六","author":"缪公恩","text":"帘动惊闻步屧声，宛然独自踏阶行。\n推窗不见人何处，风自凄清月自明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12434,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡绝句 其七","author":"缪公恩","text":"短梦初惊曙色微，半宵言笑是耶非。\n为怜弱质愁风露，月黑山深那得归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12435,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡绝句 其八","author":"缪公恩","text":"孤魂喜得傍尊亲，祖母佳城近比邻。\n应倚夜台松柏影，共看明月忆家人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12436,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡绝句 其九","author":"缪公恩","text":"剩粉零膏手泽新，青箱翠匣锁轻尘。\n最怜弱女偏珍惜，不肯开奁付与人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12437,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游蜂菊花","author":"缪公恩","text":"漫从篱下采黄华，风露凄清且闭衙。\n好是春风三二月，莫教孤负上林花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12438,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓渡浑河","author":"缪公恩","text":"未动荒鸡夜寂寥，风吹雪浪冷萧萧。\n为看沙上青霜迹，已有行人早度桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12439,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画兰","author":"缪公恩","text":"几叶淋漓草带真，有人挥洒诩传神。\n何时收取花间露，为我毫端洗俗尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12440,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送唐友梅","author":"缪公恩","text":"目断衰杨倚驿桥，天连晴雪正萧萧。\n万泉河上重携手，恰待春风碧柳条。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12441,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"检张瀛客先生遗诗 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"断简离披剩一编，最怜窥豹未能全。\n白云化去缑山鹤，春露秋霜二十年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12442,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"检张瀛客先生遗诗 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"几树松楸锁夕阳，谁题诗伯夜台坊。\n云山有梦三千里，便是生离也断肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12443,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游仙 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"瑶草琪花绕玉台，昆崙绝顶四天开。\n林间空有三青鸟，八骏东归不再来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12444,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游仙 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"碧海青天一剑孤，归来独倚旧丹炉。\n故山风月栖迟好，不看巾箱五岳图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12445,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晴望","author":"缪公恩","text":"万峰流翠雨初晴，泽被郊原草木荣。\n蜡屐最高山上望，麦苗千顷绿云平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12446,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村中","author":"缪公恩","text":"数椽茅屋自成村，半带残阳半掩门。\n烟柳低眠风不起，暮鸦声里月黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12447,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沽酒","author":"缪公恩","text":"家酿瓶之罄，来沽小市前。\n君谋花下醉，我解杖头钱。\n不惜杯三百，何妨斗十千。\n杏林春正好，共酌酒旗边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12448,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春郊即事","author":"缪公恩","text":"芳原土润绝纤埃，款段霜蹄踏碧苔。\n晓雾犹笼杨柳重，初暾欲炽杏花开。\n桑林雨霁鸠呼妇，麦垄朝和雉引媒。\n剪剪春寒风力薄，旗亭驻马暂衔杯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12449,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答阎古樵和韵","author":"缪公恩","text":"望中霁色绝嚣埃，蜡屐冲泥印软苔。\n烟烧平林青霭合，天排远岫画屏开。\n金莺出谷相求友，玉蝶寻芳互引媒。\n何日东皋同载酒，与君拈韵共传杯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12450,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同黎悦安阎古樵弈棋夜饮","author":"缪公恩","text":"风吹清漏夜漫漫，把酒敲棋兴未阑。\n乐事抵须千日醉，浮生转瞬半枰残。\n功名尘土成蕉梦，松柏冰霜结岁寒。\n聊取欢颜忘胜负，倾怀莫放一杯宽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12451,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再出东郊","author":"缪公恩","text":"芳园归几日，重适野人家。\n树树闻山鸟，村村见杏花。\n溪痕新涨雨，草色渐藏沙。\n依旧东皋路，旋看易物华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12452,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"唐友梅病中寄诗一律次韵奉覆","author":"缪公恩","text":"四年笔砚共相依，几向丹铅覈是非。\n尘榻无人联夜雨，沂风独自咏春衣。\n心怜药饵愁多病，目断云山锁落晖。\n闻道蒲觞新有约，为藏佳酿待君归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12453,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳絮","author":"缪公恩","text":"几株碧柳小窗东，弱线低垂度晓风。\n似解催人吟白雪，飘来数点砚池中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12454,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清明","author":"缪公恩","text":"墓柳青青墓草黄，一盂麦饮奠椒浆。\n可怜无限伤心泪，洒向东风血数行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12455,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后独步小园","author":"缪公恩","text":"漠漠轻阴合，孤吟小苑中。\n断云拖细雨，高树起微风。\n草入平池绿，花飞曲径红。\n徘徊对轩槛，幽兴倩谁同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12456,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"榆钱","author":"缪公恩","text":"欲买春风是也非，枝头乱挂五铢微。\n凭将柳线轻穿缀，莫逐杨花作雪花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12457,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月映万川 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"清光照破九州烟，万派澄鲜一影圆。\n滟滟金波涵静体，不随逝水下长川。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12458,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月映万川 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"素魄高悬出海天，飞来万影入澄川。\n自然妙用皆无意，水自空明月自圆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12459,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]